<title>INDONESIA: London Sumatra 9-mth net rises.</title>
<headline>London Sumatra 9-mth net rises.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Total revenue		   147.24 vs 135.36</p>
<p>    Net income			 54.45 vs  42.65</p>
<p>    Gross profit		     81.24 vs  76.27</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 71.15 vs  67.81</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		68.77 vs  59.94</p>
<p>NOTE: PT London Sumatra operates coconut, cocoa, rubber, tea and coffee plantations and also processes and trades in agricultural products.</p>
<p>--- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
